":ref:`ATC_RAT_YAW_SMAX<ATC_RAT_YAW_SMAX__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>` 用于偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:13
#: 268ff9f1cf594df1a404e5631bfd1ad4
msgid ":ref:`PSC_ACCZ_SMAX<PSC_ACCZ_SMAX>` for position control"
msgstr ":ref:`PSC_ACCZ_SMAX<PSC_ACCZ_SMAX>` 用于位置控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:11
#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:16
#: 0c6a0a43b1034c00849fbabb68863932 b4bf3ce3f4f24121be8a2419e8ea6d1c
#: b570bfb07bd8410082ff1218bed8c379 b94bcebff8bd42878672a6bfac55efe8
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The limit should be set to no more than 25% of the actuator's maximum slew "
"rate to allow for load effects."
msgstr "限制值应设置为不超过执行器最大变化率的25%，以留出负载效应的余量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:18
#: c912dcf3d80d49c38d2d8bbf69c9be9e f99b283e70be45ffa6ad15715c424892
msgid ""
"Currently the defaults for these are \"0\", disabling them. Setting them to "
"a value can be done experimentally if oscillations are present. Setting them"
" too low will result in sluggish responses."
msgstr "目前这些参数的默认值为「0」，即禁用。如果存在振荡，可以通过实验来设置相应值。设置过低会导致响应迟缓。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:14
#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:21
#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:30
#: 02f983b02eab45da9d3e1bec74f0deba 2a5bb034605a4d449db1f5acdbc3bc8e
#: 494f11a3686e4685a335fc7fb9a00b0b 92977b8f91ea4b2da7afff65d90d00a6
msgid ""
"When these values are exceeded, the appropriate PID Dmod log data ( "
"PIDR.Dmod, PIQP.DMod, etc.)will show values spiking below 1 in the plots, "
"indicating lowered gains. An ideal tune, will have this occur very "
"occasionally during operation, but not frequently. By examining the logged "
"PIDx.SRate messages one can see the actual slew rates being used and set "
"these _ SMAX values appropriately to be at or slightly above the general "
"peak slew rates."
msgstr ""
"当这些值被超过时，相应的PID "
"Dmod日志数据（PIDR.Dmod、PIQP.DMod等）将在图表中显示低于1的峰值，表示增益已降低。理想的调参结果应使此情况偶尔出现，而不是频繁发生。通过查看日志中的PIDx.SRate消息，可以看到实际使用的变化率，并相应地将这些_SMAX值设置为等于或略高于一般峰值变化率。"

